
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I usually only give one new talk a year, but this year I volunteered to give a second new talk at CppCon on a topic I haven&#8217;t spoken on before: draft C++26 contracts.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Thank you to all the experts, including the actual implementers and people who are for and against having contracts in C++26, for their time answering questions and providing papers and examples! I&#8217;ve done by best to represent the current status as I understand it, including <em>all </em>major positive must-knows and <em>all </em>major outstanding concerns and objections; any remaining errors are mine, not theirs.</p>



